4,1,,status,Kenji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Hi everyone! Let's figure out a way to fix the bin area so we can all be friends again. What should we look into first?,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to see you all. I hope we can find a solution that brings peace and a pleasant atmosphere to our lane.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need objective data. I want to know the actual time and effort required for these arrangements before we make any promises.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to make sure it's fair! It's not right if only one person has to deal with the bins. Let's find some clues!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Patience is a virtue, my dear friends. Let us look at the costs and the history to ensure our decision is sustainable for every household.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I'll check the ""Statements at the residents' meeting"" and ""The station block's meeting minutes"" to see how other people handle their arguments!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"I would like to see the ""Visit to the station block's bin house"" and ""Supervised mornings on the next lane"" to understand the daily experience.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"I will examine the ""Ward filing requirements per the installations clerk"" and ""Supervised mornings on the next lane"" to calculate the labor involved.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I'm going to look at the ""Ward complaint log for this point"" and ""Measurements of the five frontages"" to see who is suffering the most!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"I shall look into the ""Ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs"" and the ""Block ledger of refuse-point expenses"" to understand the financial burden.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, that sounds like a great plan! I bet the measurements will show us exactly where the bins can fit best.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Asuka, it is very thoughtful of you to consider the effort. I hope we find a way that doesn't tire anyone out.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shizue, thank you. Efficiency is the only way to prevent future resentment.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Servas, do you think the ward will give us money to make it pretty? I hope so!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"We shall see, little one. Money is a tool, but the spirit of cooperation is the true foundation of a happy neighborhood.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
