59,3,,status,Kenji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
60,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"Okay, we have the options! A is a permanent building, B is rotating the spot, and C is having supervised hours. I don't like A because of the fighting!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"Option A sounds like it could be smelly and cause arguments, like at the station block. Option C seems a bit strict for a friendly lane.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Option A is a bureaucratic nightmare. Option C relies on people doing a job they've already said they won't do. Option B is the most logical.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Rin,,I love Option B! It's like a traveling bin party! No one has to be the sad bin-neighbor forever. I vote for B!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Servas,,Option A is far too expensive for some of our households. Option B is cost-effective and distributes the burden. I vote for Option B.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Asuka, I agree! If we rotate, we don't need a big expensive building that people will just fight over anyway. I vote B!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Servas, if you believe B is the most considerate for our budgets, I trust your wisdom. I will also vote for Option B.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, it is not a ""party,"" but it is the only way to ensure the physical burden is shared equitably. I vote B.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Rin,,Yay! Everyone is agreeing! It's going to be so much better when we all take turns!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Servas,,"It is heartening to see such harmony. By sharing the load, we strengthen the bonds of our community.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
